# Dead or Alive 3 (4D53002D), Thor. DRAFT by lane.routeprep, 2026-09-26,
# not played. One file: DOA3 has no profile on the way to a fight.
#
# Evidence: pass 1 (0-0-y-1790433159-titleplay-p1-doa3, Thor), frames in its
# route-frames/ (t = seconds after the route started):
#   113257 t20 .. 113553 t~200: the copyright warning scrolls at 3-14 fps;
#          pass 1's START and A every ~6 s did NOT skip it
#   113559 t~206 TECMO logo; 113710 t~277 dark
#   113738 t~305 "DEAD OR ALIVE 3 / PRESS START BUTTON"; 113802, 113830 the
#          same prompt over attract backgrounds. Pass 1 was in its play
#          phase by then (stick + A), and A does not pass this screen.
#
# So: wait out the warning without pressing (nothing is gained, and a press
# queued at the wrong moment could only hurt), then START at ~310 s. The
# menus after the title are [recalled]: STORY is the first mode, character
# select takes A, then the fight. Pattern and marking as Kabuki Warriors
# (titleroutes: mark at the round start, attack without pause).
wait 100
shot warning100
wait 100
shot warning200
wait 60
shot boot260
wait 40
shot boot300                # expect PRESS START BUTTON [seen 113738]
press START
wait 5
shot after-start1           # if still the prompt, the next START takes it
press START
wait 5
shot mode-menu              # [recalled] STORY highlighted; CHECK: a second START may already have entered it
mark booted
press A                     # [recalled] Story
wait 6
shot char-select
press A                     # [recalled] the highlighted fighter
wait 5
shot costume
press A                     # [guess] costume / confirm, if asked
wait 15
shot loading
press A                     # [guess] skip the intro poses
wait 8
shot round
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the round start (timer running)
repeat forever {
    axis LX max
    wait 0.6
    press X
    wait 0.3
    press Y
    wait 0.3
    press X
    wait 0.3
    axis LX mid
    press B
    wait 0.3
    press A                 # also leaves a KO / continue screen
    wait 0.3
}
